<title>USA: Arden to pay Danka $1.865 mln.</title>
<headline>Arden to pay Danka $1.865 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Arden Group Inc said Friday that due to an arbitration decision, it is required to pay Danka Business Systems Plc about $1.865 million.</p>
<p>In a statement released late on Friday, the company said that as a result, it will recognize a loss of $2.6 million from discontinued operations in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>Arden said the arbitrators upheld its claim for $2.2 million and awarded Danka on its counterclaims $4.065 million.</p>
</text>
